│   14                                                                        │
│   15     zlib.crc32(payload) returns a CRC-32/ISO-HDLC checksum that, after │
│   16     masking with 0xFFFFFFFF, is an unsigned 32-bit integer -- this is  │
│   17     convention Modbus/RTU frame handling in this module relies on.     │
│   18                                                                        │
│   19     fastcrc exposes the equivalent algorithm as fastcrc.crc32.iso_hdlc │
│   20     which already returns an unsigned integer, but we still mask with  │
